MODULE: AliasSeparateCounter
TARGET: TruthfulAlias
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: alias admission counts only aliases, not the creates sharing the quota
PERTURBS: CheckAlias

--- FIND
         IF Cardinality(owned) + 1 > Effective THEN "refused" ELSE "admitted"]
--- REPLACE
         IF Cardinality(owned \cap Aliases) + 1 > Effective THEN "refused" ELSE "admitted"]
--- END
